    "text": "procedure Show_Precondition_Violation is\n\n   procedure Increment (X : in out Integer) with\n     Pre => X < Integer'Last  is\n   begin\n      X := X + 1;\n   end Increment;\n\n   X : Integer;\n\nbegin\n   X := Integer'Last;\n   Increment (X);\nend Show_Precondition_Violation;\n",
